#lang rzk-1

-- Probe (not a receipt) for CG001-C-456, checked on its own.
-- Why A's witnesses are an argument: the 2-sphere needs a path constructor between paths, and the
-- Eilenberg-MacLane spaces of the Agda proof need such constructors too.
-- Observed with Rzk 0.11.3 (2026-10-23): rejected with "constructor surf declares a path between
-- paths; higher path constructors are not supported yet".

#data S2 := base | surf : refl_{base} =_{base =_{S2} base} refl_{base}
